{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2023-04-26 09:01:00', 'title': 'CITIZENS BUSINESS CONDITIONS INDEX™ BOUNCES BACK IN Q1', 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CBCI--CITIZENS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS NATIONAL CITIZENS BUSINESS CONDITIONS INDEX™ (CBCI) ROSE TO 53.9 IN THE FIRST QUARTER, REFLECTING CONTINUED STRENGTH IN THE LABOR MARKET, MORE NEW BUSINESS OPENINGS AND POSITIVE CORPORATE REVENUE TRENDS. THE INDEX HAD DIPPED BELOW 50 DURING THE FOURTH QUARTER OF LAST YEAR AND THE BOUNCE-BACK DURING THE FIRST QUARTER SIGNALED A RETURN TO POSITIVE BUSINESS CONDITIONS. THE LABOR MARKET HAS REMAINED RESILIENT DESPITE AGGRESSIVE FE.'}